*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*% Jiuyin D80 portable A4/Letter thermal printer (Bluetooth SPP, NadaProtocol).
*% Filter: rastertod80. Head is 1664 dots (208 mm) at 8 dots/mm.
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "D80.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "Jiuyin"
*Product: "(D80)"
*ModelName: "Jiuyin D80"
*ShortNickName: "Jiuyin D80"
*NickName: "Jiuyin D80 thermal (rastertod80)"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "1"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*cupsVersion: 2.4
*cupsModelNumber: 0
*cupsManualCopies: True
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-raster 0 rastertod80"

*OpenUI *PageSize/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: Letter
*PageSize Letter/US Letter (fanfold): "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: Letter
*PageRegion Letter/US Letter (fanfold): "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*% 208 mm printable width, centred; full length.
*DefaultImageableArea: Letter
*ImageableArea Letter: "11.2 0 600.8 792"
*ImageableArea A4: "2.8 0 592.4 842"
*DefaultPaperDimension: Letter
*PaperDimension Letter: "612 792"
*PaperDimension A4: "595 842"

*OpenUI *Resolution/Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 203dpi
*Resolution 203dpi/203 DPI: "<</HWResolution[203 203]/cupsBitsPerColor 1/cupsColorOrder 0/cupsColorSpace 3>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*OpenUI *Darkness/Darkness: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *Darkness
*DefaultDarkness: Default
*Darkness Default/Printer default: ""
*Darkness 1/Light: ""
*Darkness 2/Medium: ""
*Darkness 3/Dark: ""
*Darkness 4/Darkest: ""
*CloseUI: *Darkness
